    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Playtest Enginefall</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/e045ade60b8f21450e256b4e6aeea86e.avif?t=1755006902\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/8b0d9211ec34e0c6aa1614d06959e53e.avif?t=1755006902\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/75f981570b0857f5220f088f4cbdd365.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/75f981570b0857f5220f088f4cbdd365.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/75f981570b0857f5220f088f4cbdd365.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive PvP in a player-driven Railworld. The Earth is in ruins, with the train network as humanity\u2019s last refuge. Colossal trains careen through the wasteland while nomadic survivors search for vital resources and a place to call home. <i>Enginefall</i> combines high-stakes PvP, survival crafting, and cross-train community building/raiding in a connected world. Craft, fight, and sabotage your way through the train\u2019s classes, take control of the engine, and build your own future.\u202f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5b2e2876ffb0d164932cbc9fed3e551a.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5b2e2876ffb0d164932cbc9fed3e551a.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5b2e2876ffb0d164932cbc9fed3e551a.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start Your Revolution:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you serve the train, or will you seize it with force? In <i>Enginefall</i> every choice can sway your fellow survivors into becoming your allies or enemies, often with violent consequences. With limited lives to complete your push for the engine, picking your fights and eliminating the competition along the way is essential.\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/c155688ca75c28538eb3e3f145914c4d.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/c155688ca75c28538eb3e3f145914c4d.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/c155688ca75c28538eb3e3f145914c4d.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take What\u2019s Yours:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare resources or pillage fuel cores from the train\u2019s engine. Evacuate to your Dagger shuttle, your personal escape pod and assault craft, to secure your spoils. Upgrade your Dagger from a creaky rust bucket to a sleek railbound menace. Board your Dagger to pause your fight and return where you left off when you\u2019re ready to continue.\u202f\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76e28d90839150d6148e799767a73721.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76e28d90839150d6148e799767a73721.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76e28d90839150d6148e799767a73721.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own an Engine:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim your own train as a persistent home, add new carriages, make your own rules, and build the community of your dreams...or your enemy\u2019s nightmares. Manage your passengers carefully, or risk an uprising of your own.\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/62e27cc1d3539109bf97ff88fa681552.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/62e27cc1d3539109bf97ff88fa681552.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/62e27cc1d3539109bf97ff88fa681552.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Derail the Opposition:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid rival player-owned trains to steal resources and eliminate competitors in the quest for dominance. But beware, there\u2019s always a bigger train waiting to strike.\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/ea3c818e35598447700909ef9b1cc07b.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/ea3c818e35598447700909ef9b1cc07b.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/ea3c818e35598447700909ef9b1cc07b.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community First Development:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Rover has been developing <i>Enginefall</i> with open playtests and community feedback at its core for well over a year. <i>Enginefall</i> is expected to leave the station in early 2026, and we want you to be part of the journey. Sign up to playtest and join our Discord to help shape the future of <i>Enginefall</i>!\u202f\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/75f981570b0857f5220f088f4cbdd365.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/75f981570b0857f5220f088f4cbdd365.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/75f981570b0857f5220f088f4cbdd365.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive PvP in a player-driven Railworld. The Earth is in ruins, with the train network as humanity\u2019s last refuge. Colossal trains careen through the wasteland while nomadic survivors search for vital resources and a place to call home. <i>Enginefall</i> combines high-stakes PvP, survival crafting, and cross-train community building/raiding in a connected world. Craft, fight, and sabotage your way through the train\u2019s classes, take control of the engine, and build your own future.\u202f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5b2e2876ffb0d164932cbc9fed3e551a.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5b2e2876ffb0d164932cbc9fed3e551a.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5b2e2876ffb0d164932cbc9fed3e551a.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start Your Revolution:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you serve the train, or will you seize it with force? In <i>Enginefall</i> every choice can sway your fellow survivors into becoming your allies or enemies, often with violent consequences. With limited lives to complete your push for the engine, picking your fights and eliminating the competition along the way is essential.\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/c155688ca75c28538eb3e3f145914c4d.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/c155688ca75c28538eb3e3f145914c4d.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/c155688ca75c28538eb3e3f145914c4d.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take What\u2019s Yours:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare resources or pillage fuel cores from the train\u2019s engine. Evacuate to your Dagger shuttle, your personal escape pod and assault craft, to secure your spoils. Upgrade your Dagger from a creaky rust bucket to a sleek railbound menace. Board your Dagger to pause your fight and return where you left off when you\u2019re ready to continue.\u202f\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76e28d90839150d6148e799767a73721.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76e28d90839150d6148e799767a73721.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76e28d90839150d6148e799767a73721.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own an Engine:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim your own train as a persistent home, add new carriages, make your own rules, and build the community of your dreams...or your enemy\u2019s nightmares. Manage your passengers carefully, or risk an uprising of your own.\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/62e27cc1d3539109bf97ff88fa681552.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/62e27cc1d3539109bf97ff88fa681552.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/62e27cc1d3539109bf97ff88fa681552.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Derail the Opposition:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid rival player-owned trains to steal resources and eliminate competitors in the quest for dominance. But beware, there\u2019s always a bigger train waiting to strike.\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/ea3c818e35598447700909ef9b1cc07b.poster.avif?t=1755006902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/ea3c818e35598447700909ef9b1cc07b.webm?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/ea3c818e35598447700909ef9b1cc07b.mp4?t=1755006902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community First Development:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Rover has been developing <i>Enginefall</i> with open playtests and community feedback at its core for well over a year. <i>Enginefall</i> is expected to leave the station in early 2026, and we want you to be part of the journey. Sign up to playtest and join our Discord to help shape the future of <i>Enginefall</i>!\u202f\u00a0</p>",
